us</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1333303-pathfinder-1e-support?p=1409938#post1409938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... can someone post more Pathfinder content to the Slarecian Vault or is that verboten now?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can absolutely still post Pathfinder 1e content to Slarecian Vault.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-12T14:50:49-08:00","id":1428210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrackedMan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1333303-pathfinder-1e-support?p=1404199#post1404199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was the reasoning for this decision stated somewhere? Or is it just because Pathfinder has a 2nd edition now?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mainly due to Pathfinder moving to 2e, but I would like to stress that Pathfinder versions &amp; conversion are absolutely okay to post at the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_29809/Slarecian-Vault\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Slarecian Vault</b></a>, including conversions of the new 5e materials such as <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/337291/Yugmans-Guide-to-Ghelspad-Part-Six-5e-OGL\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Yugman's Guide to Ghelspad</b></a> or <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/328484/Frostlands-of-Fenrilik\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Frostlands of Fenrilik </b></a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1333303-pathfinder-1e-support?p=1409751#post1409751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would like to know more in that subject too.<br /> That said, how is the matter of 5e material going?</div> </div> </div> </div>Amazing! We have had a TON of releases for Scarred Lands 5e including<b> Vigil Watch</b> and <b>Yugman's Guide to Ghelspad</b> and we have the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Dead Man's Rust Kickstarter</b></a> active NOW which contains a full campaign from levels 1-10 and a wealth of information on the Hornsaw Forest, the Gleaming Valley, and Glivid-Autel<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]